      "mergeID": "6807b6f3c08a2e1dd6e2af37",
      "mergedPostDetails": "You can reset your Profile picture photo on the website, but there is no way to do this in the client itself.\n\nBy reset I mean return it to showing your currently worn avatar. The only way to do this in-client is to let your subscription run out.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "There is no way to reset a VRC+ Profile picture in-client.",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "67ff00b9175555ae15b2efe2",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found a workaround in-client. Step 1. Take a new photo, 2. Set it as the profile picture, 3. Then delete it.\n\nAnd there isn't a way to reset it on the website right now. I'm not sure, but maybe we had some updates.",
